  "description": "*“The devil burrows into a person’s weakened heart and stirs up desire.”*\n\nFather Park Se-Jin, a priest revered by his congregation. Assistant Priest Im Dong-Hui, who stands by his side and watches him quietly. To Dong-Hui, who has long suppressed his feelings for the revered Father Se-Jin through prayer, another voice whispers: “Don’t lie.” Once unleashed, desire cannot be hidden again, and at the very edge of their crumbling faith, the two priests come face to face. Is this the devil’s trap, or is it my true self, the one I’ve been turning away from all along?\n\n(Source: MrBlue, translated)",
